# =====================================================================
# Release V095 -- Wire Meta.usp_Sync_Input_From_AppDB into the nightly build
# =====================================================================
# Adds META_SYNC_INPUT to Process_Config and a step in usp_Load_All at the Silver->Gold boundary
# (before Gold dims/facts read Input.*), so the owner-curated targets/roles/variances entered in
# the app (AppDB) are copied into WH_Dentally.Input.* each build -> Fact_Daily_Targets then populates.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V095__wire_appdb_sync_into_build.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Audit.Process_Config.Data.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Audit.usp_Load_All.sql

TEST
